---
// Band 2 — Intro statement.
// A typographic moment (not a boxed card): one to two large-type sentences in
// the community's voice, drawn from the Play page intro. Copy is inline for now
// and editable later.
---

<section class="home-band home-reveal" aria-label="What bike polo is">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4">
    <p class="intro-statement text-chalk text-pretty">
      Bike polo is three on three, mallets up, on a fenced court. Come as you
      are — grab a loaner, take your dabs, and jump in.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro-statement {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
</style>
